      "description": "Vista del trigger y de su menú; el valor elegido se ajusta en varias líneas en vez de truncarse. La acción Svelte conserva el select original y su validación.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-select\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-select-trigger\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"ds-select-options\" aria-label=\"¿Hasta cuándo pueden reservar?\"><span>Próximos 30 días</span><span class=\"ds-select-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/></svg></span></button><div class=\"ds-select-menu\" id=\"ds-select-options\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"¿Hasta cuándo pueden reservar?\"><div class=\"ds-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">Próximos 15 días</div><div class=\"ds-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\">Próximos 30 días</div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-select{color:var(--text,#eaf1ff);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;}.ds-select-trigger{width:100%;min-height:var(--tap,2.75rem);border-radius:var(--radius,1rem);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);padding:.75rem 1rem;color:var(--text,#eaf1ff);font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 160ms ease,box-shadow 160ms ease,background-color 160ms ease;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-weight:400}.ds-select-trigger>span:first-child{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-select-trigger[aria-expanded=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--accent,#8b5cf6)}.ds-select-trigger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-text,#c4b5fd);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-select-trigger:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-select-icon{width:1.1rem;height:1.1rem;color:var(--text-muted,rgba(234,241,255,.64));flex-shrink:0}.ds-select-icon svg{width:100%;height:100%;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-select-menu{margin-top:6px;padding:.4rem;border:1px solid var(--border-strong,#244062);border-radius:.75rem;background:var(--surface-raised,#102842);color:var(--text,#eaf1ff);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #0005;font-size:1rem}.ds-select-option{padding:.65rem .75rem;min-height:var(--tap,2.75rem);border-radius:.45rem;cursor:pointer;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-select-option:hover{background:#213c5b}.ds-select-option[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:var(--accent-soft,rgba(124,58,237,.18));color:#e2d6ff;font-weight:600}.ds-select-option[aria-disabled=\"true\"]{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}"
    },
